        "title": "Digital Sensors",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Shot noise:    σ_shot = √N  (where N = number of photons)\n                → 10,000 photons → SNR = 100:1 → 40 dB\n                → 100 photons → SNR = 10:1 → 20 dB\n                UNAVOIDABLE — physics, not engineering"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-DIGITAL-SENSORS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "06-DIGITAL-SENSORS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
