        "section": "photography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Digital Sensors",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Read noise:    Amplifier thermal/electronic noise at readout\n                Modern CMOS: 1–3 electrons RMS\n                → Only dominates when N << read_noise²\n                → At base ISO with good exposure: shot noise dominates"
    },
