      "text": "Dynamic range: log₂(full_well / read_noise) in stops\n                Typical: 4,000 e⁻ well / 4 e⁻ read = 1,000:1 → ~10 stops\n                Modern BSI CMOS: 14–15 stops at base ISO\n```"
