      "text": "PIXEL CIRCUIT (4T):\n    +-----------------------------------------------------+\n    |  PD --> Transfer gate (TX) --> FD                   |\n    |                                |                    |\n    |                                v                    |\n    |                       Source follower amplifier     |\n    |                       --> Row select                |\n    |                       --> Column bus --> Column ADC |\n    +-----------------------------------------------------+\n    (FD = floating diffusion: charge -> voltage)"
    },
